  ("Meminta pinjam catatan.", "Classmate: I missed the lesson yesterday.", "Tawarkan meminjamkan catatan.", "You can borrow my notes. // I can lend you my notebook. // Do you want to see my notes?", "borrow,notes,lend,notebook"),
  ("Terlambat ke kelas.", "Teacher: Why are you late?", "Minta maaf dan jelaskan bus terlambat.", "I'm sorry. The bus was late. // Sorry, I missed the bus. // Excuse me, the traffic was bad.", "sorry,bus,late,traffic"),
  ("Presentasi.", "Teacher: Please start your presentation.", "Buka presentasi dengan sopan.", "Good morning, everyone. Today I'll talk about recycling. // Hello, everyone. My topic is healthy food. // Good morning. I'm going to present our project.", "morning,topic,talk,present,everyone"),
  ("Presentasi selesai.", "Teacher: Thank you. Are there any questions?", "Ucapkan terima kasih atas perhatian.", "Thank you for listening. // Thank you for your attention. // Thanks, everyone.", "thank,listening,attention"),
